Friends! It’s summer! And we’re once again asking for your help in clearing the lists of some truly deserving teachers who are in need of some classroom supplies for next school year. It’s a sad reality that our great teachers don’t get the support they need to cover classroom needs and are often expected to meet these needs using their own funds from their salaries that are already lower than they deserve. If you’re able, please help pick up an item or two as we work to #ClearTheList ! 
And now, a school days roundup to make you glad that it’s SUNDAY and it’s JUNE and you’re like THIRTY EIGHT and for these reasons... NO ONE IS GOING TO MAKE YOU RUN A TIMED MILE OR DO A TIMED MATH TEST AND THAT’S SOMETHING TO BE THANKFUL FOR #bless Happy day, fam! Glad you’re here. 
Credit/ jalonjackson_ 
Credit/ ravenswng_
@lloydlegalist_ 
Credit/ vveetto & riomat7
@miyuaihara 
Credit/ 06fordexplorer
Credit/ rsf788
@caucasianjames & @ufobri 
@clareblackwood 
@roywoodjr

