*nervously approaches the mic, trembling slightly under the bright spotlight. displaying a level of grace and sophistication rarely observed at a suburban open mic night, I clear my throat and begin*
“She had dumps like a truck, truck, truck. Thighs like what, what, what. Baby, move your butt, butt, butt. I think I’ll sing it again.  She had dumps like a truck, truck, truck. Thighs like what, what, what. All night long. Let me see that thong.” 
The audience goes wild, not a dry eye in the house, everyone’s dumps are like trucks because no one really knows what that means / open to interpretation/ but it is probably a good thing that means everyone is happy? Another successful open mic night in the books. 
My dear friends, to those who are currently wearing a thong and to those who are not... I HOPE YOUR FRICKIN WEEKEND IS A MAGNIFICENT ONE! YOU DESERVE IT! I AM CURRENTLY ON MY WAY TO A LEGALLY BLONDE PARTY IN MANHATTAN AND I AM WEARING A PINK SHIRT AND A SMILE (and no thong because it is not 2004). WHAT ARE YOU DOING TODAY?
@emilykmayy & credit/ suannelqr
@themissybaker 
@sisqo & ritawhoras

