To every dad out there, to the grandpas too, to the kid dads and rainbow dads, plant dads, pet dads, father figures, bad ass fun uncles, to all of the people missing a dad today (sending you the biggest e-hug on the planet - all the love to you!), to OUR dads Bruce and Eric... a happy, happy, happy father’s day to you. 
FATHER’S DAY ROUNDUP TIME! (and I am once again needing to ask why the mothers have a decent amount of song choices — MAMA by Spice Girls, for example, and for dads we’ve got ... like... Father Figure?? —I will be your father (I will be your) I will be your preacher (Father) I will be your father (I’ll be your daddy, oh) I will be the one who loves you ‘Til the end of time — can someone get on this??)
Credit/ astralfvck
@kateclayborn.author 
@emilykmayy 
Credit/ utalex05
@pidgewilliams 
Credit/ guiseofgentlewords
Credit/ xanaxcowboy_
